---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Changelog - DevMagic"
  description="Version history and changes for DevMagic."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Changelog</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-8">
        All notable changes to DevMagic are documented here.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Version 0.1.0 -->
        <article class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6">
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">v0.1.0</h2>
            <time class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2024-11-16</time>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mb-2">Added</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-1 text-muted-foreground text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Initial release of DevMagic portable development environment</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Support for three usage modes: standalone, consumer (git submodule), and maintainer</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>VS Code Dev Container configuration with pre-built Ubuntu images</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Auxiliary services via Docker Compose: PostgreSQL, Redis, MongoDB, MinIO, Ollama</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Automatic mounting of host credentials (SSH, GitHub, Claude)</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Pre-configured VS Code extensions for productivity</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Documentation website at devmagic.run</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Setup script endpoint with version pinning support</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Installation script for quick setup</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-primary">•</span>
                  <span>Apache 2.0 license</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Future versions will be added here -->
        <div class="bg-muted/50 rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
            This changelog is automatically generated from commit history using conventional commits.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-2">
            For the latest changes, see the <a href="https://github.com/marcelocra/devmagic/commits/main" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">commit history on GitHub</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Version Info -->
      <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Release Schedule</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            DevMagic follows semantic versioning. New versions are released as needed based on features and fixes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">GitHub Releases</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3">
            Detailed release notes are available on GitHub:
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/marcelocra/devmagic/releases"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-primary hover:underline text-sm font-medium"
          >
            View all releases →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
